# ===== eSACfinal .gitignore =====

# --- NEVER COMMIT: secrets ---
secrets/
*_key
*.pem
id_*

# --- runtime outputs / logs (regenerated by harnesses) ---
results/
*.log
*.outer.log
*.out
*.tsv
hist.txt
runtime.log

# --- scratch / temp ---
*.swp
*~
.*_dir
*.done

# ===== OPTIONAL: source-only repo =====
# The tree ships prebuilt static binaries so it runs after deleting every other
# directory (see README "self-contained"). That is ~1 GB. If you prefer a small,
# source-only Git repo, UNCOMMENT the block below to exclude the heavy binaries
# and rebuild/fetch them with the build notes in README.md. Leave commented to
# keep a clone-and-run artifact (use git-lfs for the large objects if desired).
#
# agent/*.so
# traffic/dperf*
# suricata/bin/suricata
# suricata/lib/
# apps/redis/redis-server
# apps/nginx/nginx
# tamper_sentinel/bin/tamper_sentinel*
# lib/

# ===== source-only GitHub snapshot: exclude prebuilt binaries & heavy third-party =====
agent/*.so
tamper_sentinel/bin/
traffic/dperf*
traffic/control_churn*
traffic/flow_churn
traffic/flow_throttle_loader
traffic/cp_governor_loader
apps/redis/redis-server
apps/nginx/nginx
suricata/bin/
suricata/lib/
lib/
l7/**/*.so
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak-rate
secrets/
results/
